cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "XRef Code — Ultra Blazing Fast x86-64 ELF and Mach-O Analysis, Pseudo-C and Local MCP"
abstract: >-
  Ultra blazing fast x86-64 ELF and supported thin Mach-O cross-references, layout recovery,
  backward slicing and typed pseudo-C in safe Rust. Versioned JSON queries and
  a local stdio MCP interface expose bounded investigations, call-site
  alternatives and field-origin evidence. Function ranges use DWARF FDEs;
  incomplete control flow, metadata and search limits remain explicit.
